      "agent_input": "Please open and review the data in data/sales_q3.csv so I can identify the relevant won deals for James Okafor and Sofia Delgado.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "Here's the complete review of **sales_q3.csv** with the won deals for both reps:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcca Full Dataset Overview\nThe file contains **22 deals** across Q3 2026 (July\u2013September) with columns: `deal_id`, `rep_name`, `region`, `product`, `amount`, `close_date`, `status`. Three reps are represented: James Okafor, Sofia Delgado, and Marcus Webb.\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Won Deals \u2014 **James Okafor** (7 deals, **$571,500** total)\n\n| Deal ID | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date |\n|---------|--------|----------------------|----------|------------|\n| D001 | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $87,500 | 2026-07-05 |\n| D003 | East | Meridian DataBridge | $43,000 | 2026-07-12 |\n| D006 | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $120,000 | 2026-07-22 |\n| D009 | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $95,000 | 2026-08-05 |\n| D012 | West | Meridian DataBridge | $66,000 | 2026-08-14 |\n| D015 | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $88,000 | 2026-08-25 |\n| D017 | North | Meridian DataBridge | $72,000 | 2026-09-02 |\n\n> *Note: D020 ($115,000, Meridian Insights Pro, West) is still **pending**.*\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Won Deals \u2014 **Sofia Delgado** (6 deals, **$460,000** total)\n\n| Deal ID | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date |\n|---------|--------|----------------------|----------|------------|\n| D002 | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $62,000 | 2026-07-08 |\n| D005 | North | Meridian DataBridge | $55,000 | 2026-07-19 |\n| D008 | West | Meridian DataBridge | $38,000 | 2026-08-02 |\n| D010 | East | Meridian Insights Pro | $74,000 | 2026-08-09 |\n| D019 | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $198,000 | 2026-09-05 |\n| D021 | North | Meridian DataBridge | $33,000 | 2026-09-07 |\n\n> *Note: D013 ($105,000) is **pending** and D016 ($47,000) was **lost** \u2014 neither counted.*\n\n---\n\n### Key Takeaways\n- **James Okafor** leads with **7 won deals** totaling **$571,500** (plus 1 pending).\n- **Sofia Delgado** has **6 won deals** totaling **$460,000** (plus 1 pending, 1 lost).\n- Both reps sell across all four regions and work with both **Meridian Insights Pro** and **Meridian DataBridge** products.\n- Sofia's single largest deal (D019, $198,000) is the biggest won deal in the entire dataset.",
